<title>USA: Rhode Island deal won by Prudential Securities.</title>
<headline>Rhode Island deal won by Prudential Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc. said it won $76 million of Rhode Island and Providence Plantations general obligations, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.180 percent.</p>
</text>
